{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Live Cockpit Map",
  "theme": "lcmap",
  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "A copy of BMW's own iDrive 7 Live Cockpit screen with the map up, generated by tools/gen_lcmap.py (edit that and regenerate). One hexlc effect layer draws the black backdrop, the blue speed bracket (0..200 mph) and the red rev bracket (0..7000), each a bold outer line, a band shaded inwards and lit to the value and an inner line, with their top and bottom runs, and the slanted fuel and oil gauges in the lower corners. While the map shows inside the theme ('mapUp': Maps on cluster, CarPlay's Apple Maps / Waze / Google Maps) the hexagon's inside is cut see-through over it, only within BMW's map window (416,120 1088x480), without a rebuild (mapLive); otherwise it stays a dark night-map blue. Each bracket's colour glows in over the map's edges. The brackets, scale numbers and gauges are the Sport theme's, traced off a real car; the speed and gear sit inside the hexagon as in the photo; the clock, range and outside temperature in the bottom strip, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
